.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.PP
.nf
Handwritten parser of dependency specifiers\&.

The docstring for each __parse_* function contains EBNF-inspired grammar representing
the implementation\&.

.fi
.PP
 
.SH "Function Documentation"
.PP 
.SS " list[str] pip\&._vendor\&.packaging\&._parser\&._parse_extras (\fBTokenizer\fP tokenizer)\fC [protected]\fP"

.PP
.nf
extras = (LEFT_BRACKET wsp* extras_list? wsp* RIGHT_BRACKET)?

.fi
.PP
 
.SS " list[str] pip\&._vendor\&.packaging\&._parser\&._parse_extras_list (\fBTokenizer\fP tokenizer)\fC [protected]\fP"

.PP
.nf
extras_list = identifier (wsp* ',' wsp* identifier)*

.fi
.PP
 
.SS " \fBMarkerList\fP pip\&._vendor\&.packaging\&._parser\&._parse_full_marker (\fBTokenizer\fP tokenizer)\fC [protected]\fP"

.SS " \fBMarkerList\fP pip\&._vendor\&.packaging\&._parser\&._parse_marker (\fBTokenizer\fP tokenizer)\fC [protected]\fP"

.PP
.nf
marker = marker_atom (BOOLOP marker_atom)+

.fi
.PP
 
.SS " \fBMarkerAtom\fP pip\&._vendor\&.packaging\&._parser\&._parse_marker_atom (\fBTokenizer\fP tokenizer)\fC [protected]\fP"

.PP
.nf
marker_atom = WS? LEFT_PARENTHESIS WS? marker WS? RIGHT_PARENTHESIS WS?
            | WS? marker_item WS?

.fi
.PP
 
.SS " \fBMarkerItem\fP pip\&._vendor\&.packaging\&._parser\&._parse_marker_item (\fBTokenizer\fP tokenizer)\fC [protected]\fP"

.PP
